OL,3,CMan in court over death of girl found
OL,4,Cinjured on industrial estate
OL,6,FPolice in Scotland have charged a man
OL,7,Fover the death of a girl found on an
OL,8,Findustrial estate.
OL,10,FThe nine-year-old girl from West
OL,11,FYorkshire was discovered injured on
OL,12,Fthe Elliot industrial estate in
OL,13,FArbroath, 17 miles north of Dundee,
OL,14,Fshortly after midnight on Monday
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,17,FThe child was taken to Ninewells
OL,18,FHospital along with the man and three
OL,19,Ffamily members for treatment.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/4
