PN,33902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786310307
OL,3,CMan in court over death of girl found
OL,4,Cinjured on industrial estate
OL,6,FShe died in hospital, with Police
OL,7,FScotland confirming they were treating
OL,8,Fher death as suspicious.
OL,10,FA 35-year-old man has been charged in
OL,11,Fconnection with her death and was due
OL,12,Fto appear before Forfar Sheriff Court
OL,13,Fon Wednesday.
OL,15,FHe is described as white British.
OL,16,FPolice have said he was known to the
OL,17,Fgirl, adding they were not looking for
OL,18,Fanyone else.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/4
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
