FL,340,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786310307
OL,3,CMan in court over death of girl found
OL,4,Cinjured on industrial estate
OL,6,FThe force said the girl was believed
OL,7,Fto have been camping with her family
OL,8,Fin the area when the incident happened
OL,9,FHer family are being supported by
OL,10,Fspecialist officers.
OL,12,FDet Insp Mike Ness of Police
OL,13,FScotland's major investigation team
OL,14,Fsaid: "Our thoughts remain with those
OL,15,Faffected by these events.
OL,17,F"A police presence will remain in the
OL,18,Farea while our inquiries continue."
OL,26,@vD@GOUyD@AOU
