PN,33904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F339A1786310307
OL,3,CMan in court over death of girl found
OL,4,Cinjured on industrial estate
OL,6,FA cordon and forensics tent were still
OL,7,Fat the scene on Tuesday, where members
OL,8,Fof the public and police could be seen
OL,9,Flaying flowers.
OL,11,FA spokesperson for West Yorkshire
OL,12,FPolice, who are understood to be
OL,13,Fsupporting Police Scotland's
OL,14,Finvestigation, declined to comment
OL,15,Ffurther.
OL,17,FAnyone with further information on the
OL,18,Fincident has been urged to contact
OL,19,FPolice Scotland.
